A tab separates two attributes, and pads a block, as a space does

```
*x*{.a	.b}

*y*{	.c}

*z*{.d	}
.
<p><strong>x</strong>{.a	.b}</p>
<p><strong>y</strong>{	.c}</p>
<p><strong>z</strong>{.d	}</p>
```

```
*x*{k=a	.b}

*y*{k="a	b"}
.
<p><strong>x</strong>{k=a	.b}</p>
<p><strong k="a	b">y</strong></p>
```

```
[x]{	}
.
<p>[x]{	}</p>
```
